WEBVTT

01:01:57.832 --> 01:02:00.584
you know, one of the opportunities
and one of burdens is,

01:02:00.608 --> 01:02:03.302
it's a collective problem
that we have to solve together.

01:02:03.326 --> 01:02:08.043
And so, to me, it is the specter
and the hope that this is the problem

01:02:08.067 --> 01:02:10.375
around which we can build
a global community.

01:02:10.399 --> 01:02:12.303
And I'll go back to the Bible.

01:02:12.327 --> 01:02:14.542
This is a Rabbi Jonathan Sacks point.

01:02:14.566 --> 01:02:17.496
The Book of Exodus has hundreds
and hundreds of verses

01:02:17.520 --> 01:02:19.720
on the building of the Tabernacle.

01:02:19.744 --> 01:02:23.235
Why do they have hundreds of verses
around building this little structure?

01:02:23.259 --> 01:02:26.795
It's because a community is a group
of people who build something together.

01:02:26.819 --> 01:02:29.300
Sacks's book is called
"The Home We Build Together."

01:02:29.324 --> 01:02:32.431
So, dealing with global warming
is the project that can unify us.